# Direct dependencies and the ranges we accept. Edit this file, then regenerate the pinned
# lockfile that the Dockerfile and CI install:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt --python-version 3.13 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28
# A rebuild (including the weekly fresh-base one) only ever installs requirements.txt, so app
# library versions change only through a reviewed lockfile change (Dependabot or by hand).
# Each range stops before the next major, so a regenerated lockfile cannot jump one unreviewed.
